WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Coming from FL Studio Mobile? Open your song with File, Open.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.400
LYNX SHARE tells you what it had to change. Here, MiniSynth plays a LYNX synth sound.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.600
The song opens in the Simple layout, one track per instrument.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.600
Press Play: the patterns, the tempo and the mix are there.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:30.200
Click a track to edit it in the dock below.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.000
BandLab projects as .blx, and GarageBand .band files, open the same way.
